      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "羅莎琳 · 克魯茲希卡 · 洛厄法特出生於 500 多年前的蒙德。\n魯斯坦\n羅莎琳的戀人，已逝的西風騎士團「幼狼」騎士、西風劍術創始人。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7034,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "羅莎琳曾在須彌教令院求學。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7089,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "當災厄席捲提瓦特時，羅莎琳正在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3799,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "求學。待她返回蒙德時，親人、朋友與摯愛都已逝去。失去一切後，她化身為了炎之魔女。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7474,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "最初招募羅莎琳加入愚人眾的執行官給了她冰之邪眼，以壓制體內燃燒的烈焰。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7106,
        "name": "愚人眾",
        "desc": "<p>一個效忠於冰之女皇的至冬組織，其勢力遍布整個大陸。該組織的執行官們正在追尋「神之心」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/27/368338997/159454dca0123d1c63a52568b03a0a26_8998728010362045421.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "女士是愚人眾十一執行官中的第八席。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7468,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "女士襲擊了風神並奪走了他的風",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4935,
        "name": "神之心",
        "desc": "<p>神之心是塵世七執政各自擁有的魔力器官，與天空島共鳴相連，同時也是其身份與地位的象徵。<span class=\"wk-shady\">後來揭示，神之心是由「第三降臨者」的骸骨所製而成。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/03/04/142453215/bab2af9d5bf04a15d02410a09d2ded59_8668610760497980182.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7469,
        "name": "摩拉克斯",
        "desc": "<p>璃月的岩神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/12/368338997/8e662b610f4bd4eaefa43643379094db_5800295406074082258.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "透過",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7473,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "與岩王帝君的契約，女士獲得了岩神之心。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4583,
        "name": "斯卡拉姆齊",
        "desc": "<p>前愚人眾執行官第六席，由雷電影創造。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/29/368338997/3ca9b9e2138195540f079c470acfbce5_5300326996385643366.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "女士曾與斯卡拉姆齊在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3798,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的邪眼工廠合作，試圖動搖稻妻的政局。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 49,
        "name": "雷電將軍",
        "desc": "其身為御建鳴神主尊大御所大人，許稻妻人民以亙古不變之「永恆」。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/character/Raiden Shogun_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在御前決鬥中失敗後，女士被雷電將軍以「無想的一刀」處決。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
